flowchart LR
    %% Representative exchanges accompanying E2/E3 and the E6 ordinary workflow; learners add justified boundaries.
    EXT[Partner client]
    INT[Analyst client]
    ADM[Administrator client]
    WEB["FRX portal (gateway in deployment proposal)"]
    INTAKE[Managed intake and registration: outside build]
    DB[(Identity and report records)]
    FILES[(File intake store)]
    LOG[(Event log)]
    ANALYTICS[Analytics provider]

    EXT -->|credentials, session cookie, report ID, search text, filename and bytes| WEB
    INT -->|credentials, session cookie, report ID, search text, analytics input| WEB
    ADM -->|credentials, session cookie, report ID, search text| WEB
    WEB -->|session cookie, report results, stored filename, status| EXT
    WEB -->|session cookie, report results, analytics result, status| INT
    WEB -->|session cookie, report results, status| ADM
    WEB -->|user lookup, report ID, search criteria| DB
    DB -->|account and report records| WEB
    WEB -->|stored filename and file bytes| FILES
    WEB -->|event records| LOG
    WEB -->|request containing report identifier| ANALYTICS
    ANALYTICS -->|report identifier and score| WEB
    INTAKE -.->|registered reports, owner and analyst assignment metadata| DB
